<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Excessive girth during penetration caused internal tearing. The injury is painful and may bleed or become infected if not properly treated.-->
  <RES_StretchTear.description>过度粗大的插入导致内部撕裂。这种损伤很痛苦，如果不妥善处理可能会出血或感染。</RES_StretchTear.description>
  <!--EN: tear-->
  <RES_StretchTear.label>撕裂</RES_StretchTear.label>
  <!--EN: a tear-->
  <RES_StretchTear.labelNoun>一处撕裂</RES_StretchTear.labelNoun>
  <!--EN: Excessive length during penetration caused deep internal tearing beyond the outer orifice. The injury is painful and may bleed or become infected if not properly treated.-->
  <RES_StretchTearLenght.description>过长的插入导致外口以内的深处内部撕裂。这种损伤很痛苦，如果不妥善处理可能会出血或感染。</RES_StretchTearLenght.description>
  <!--EN: deep tear-->
  <RES_StretchTearLenght.label>深度撕裂</RES_StretchTearLenght.label>
  <!--EN: a deep tear-->
  <RES_StretchTearLenght.labelNoun>一处深度撕裂</RES_StretchTearLenght.labelNoun>
</LanguageData>